    "description": "Devyani International Holdings Services is actively seeking a talented and motivated Hotel Manager to join our dynamic team in Pimpri-Chinchwad. This is an excellent opportunity for professionals who are passionate about making a real impact in a fast-growing organization.\n\nAbout Devyani International Holdings Services:\nDevyani International Holdings Services is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Monitor F&B service quality and maintain hygiene standards\n• Deliver exceptional guest experiences in line with brand standards\n• Assist in menu planning, costing, and food festival coordination\n• Coordinate housekeeping and maintenance for room readiness\n• Manage procurement of hotel supplies and control operating costs\n• Manage reservations and optimize room revenue through yield management\n• Coordinate with travel agents and OTAs for occupancy optimization\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• B.Com / M.Com / MBA Finance\n• 0-1 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Housekeeping Standards\n• Proficiency in PMS Systems\n• Proficiency in Revenue Management\n• Proficiency in Travel Management\n• Proficiency in Front Office\n• Proficiency in Event Management\n• Proficiency in Sommelier Skills\n• Proficiency in MICE\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Mobile and internet reimbursement\n• Annual performance appraisal\n• Provident Fund and Gratuity as per company policy\n• Flexible working hours\n• Meal coupons and food allowance\n• Comprehensive health insurance for self and family\n• Salary Range: 2.5 LPA - 6 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Pimpri-Chinchwad, Maharashtra, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Devyani International Holdings Services!",
